---
3md: 1.0
view: play
category: Animation
axis: generation
legend: .=· o=█
billboard: true
title: Conway Spacetime - an R-pentomino, generation by generation
rule: B3/S23
seed: R-pentomino
note: Fifteen generations of an R-pentomino. Play them, or blend them so the generation axis becomes depth.
---
Each plane is one generation of Conway's Game of Life. The seed is an
R-pentomino. A dot is an empty cell and o is a live cell. These are the first
fifteen generations. Scrub the planes to watch it move. Blend them and the
generations stack into depth.

@plane z=0 label="gen 0 - 5 alive"
# generation 0

